==Russian==

===Etymology===
Probably {{lit|to go the same path that someone has gone|to [[follow in someone's footsteps]]|nocap=1}}, from {{der|ru|cu|дра́га|t=road, path, way}} (see {{m|ru|доро́га}}). Over time, the meaning shifted to "to reproduce something or someone's actions".

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|подража́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-подражать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|подража́ть|impf}}

# to [[imitate]], to [[copy]], to [[ape]] {{+obj|ru|dat<someone>}}
#: {{ux|ru|Ви́тя '''подража́ет''' [[старший|ста́ршему]] [[брат|бра́ту]] [[во]] [[весь|всём]].|Vitya imitates (his) elder brother in everything.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|1a|подража́ть}}

